ng area without a limiter then she  proceeds to beat and torture satelizer  gazuyat tries to stop the fight but  ganesa slaps him away causing the  untouchable queen to go into pandora  mode as well and defeats garnessa the  teacher and medical officer stop the  fight and they punish both girls by  putting them in the prison later gazuya  meets the headmistress sister margaret  and his dorm neighbor arthur who's the  partner of ganesa meanwhile a pandora  named miyabi takes an interest in gazuya  and wants to make him her newest limiter  after introducing himself to his class  and having lunch with class  representatives gazuyat sees the  untouchable queen and decides to  apologize to her properly he finds her  on the rooftop and through their  conversations he's glad to find that  she's a shy and nice person arthur's  shocked to find that kazuya can talk to  her normally however third year pandora  miyabi and her three limiters arrive  miyabi offers kazuya to be her limiter  but when he rejects she threatens kazuya  which prompts the untouchable queen to  raise her weapon against her after  taking a strike to her face which angers  her miyabi orders her limiters to freeze  both gazuya and satelizer and beat them  as miyabi and her limiters humiliate and  slightly harass satellites gazuya  activates his freezing powers to stop  them by the time the teacher and the  rest arrive to stop the fight the  untouchable queen has brutally beaten  miyabi and her limiters and is about to  deliver a deadly blow when gazuya pleads  with her to stop which she does as kim  and elise learn the secrets of gazuya's  abilities the student president warns  him again to stay away from the  untouchable queen because she's now the  target of the other third years who  don't take likely to those who  disrespect the academy's hierarchy after  spending a week in solitary confinement  for her actions sateliser faces another  third year who challenges her to a duel  to punish her for going aga